spans.s:
नासिक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, being in the nose; uttered
through the nose, nasal; (अस्), m. any nasal sound; a
peculiar nasal sound related to the so-called Yamas;
(आस्), m. pl., N. of a people in Dakṣiṇā-patha;
(औ), du. = नासत्यौ, the two sons of Aśvinī, the
Aśvins; (अम्), n. the nose; N. of a town.
